# Remember to never publicly share your keystore.
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
key.properties
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# One exception, and it is not a secret: this example's debug identity. Alias
# `androiddebugkey`, password `android` — the well-known pair every Android SDK installation
# generates, and one Play rejects on upload. It is committed so the example is signed by the
# same certificate on macOS, Windows and every CI run; see app/build.gradle.kts for why that
# matters. A negation, so every other keystore stays blocked.
!app/debug.keystore
